<view class="page"><view class="brand">ADC DENTAL CARE · 本人档案</view><view class="title">{{caseId?'补充申请资料':'先核对本人，再安排就诊'}}</view><view class="subtitle">此申请仅关联本人，代约他人仍由前台核验关系与授权。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{patientMessage}}" class="notice">{{patientMessage}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{!preview}}" class="card"><label class="label">办理门店</label><picker range="{{clinics}}" range-key="name" value="{{clinicIndex}}" bindchange="clinic" disabled="{{busy||caseId}}"><view class="input">{{clinics[clinicIndex].name||'选择门店'}}</view></picker><label class="label">办理事项</label><picker range="{{kinds}}" value="{{kindIndex}}" bindchange="kind" disabled="{{busy||caseId||restoreOnly}}"><view class="input">{{kinds[kindIndex]}}</view></picker>
<label class="label" for="patient-name">本人姓名</label><input id="patient-name" class="input" value="{{form.name}}" maxlength="80" data-field="name" bindinput="field" />
<label class="label">出生日期</label><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date_of_birth}}" bindchange="date"><view class="input">{{form.date_of_birth||'选择出生日期'}}</view></picker>
<label class="label" for="patient-phone">联络号码</label><input id="patient-phone" class="input" value="{{form.phone}}" maxlength="32" data-field="phone" bindinput="field" /><view class="muted">共享号码不会合并患者；该资料尚待人工核对。</view>
<label class="label" for="patient-address">账单／联系地址（新建档必填）</label><input id="patient-address" class="input" value="{{form.billing_address}}" maxlength="255" data-field="billing_address" bindinput="field" />
<label class="label" for="patient-email">电子邮箱（选填）</label><input id="patient-email" class="input" value="{{form.email}}" maxlength="254" data-field="email" bindinput="field" />
<label class="label" for="emergency-name">紧急联系人（新建档必填）</label><input id="emergency-name" class="input" value="{{form.emergency_name}}" maxlength="80" data-field="emergency_name" bindinput="field" />
<label class="label" for="emergency-phone">紧急联系电话（新建档必填）</label><input id="emergency-phone" class="input" value="{{form.emergency_phone}}" maxlength="32" data-field="emergency_phone" bindinput="field" />
<label class="label" for="patient-reference">原患者编号（记得时填写）</label><input id="patient-reference" class="input" value="{{form.patient_reference}}" maxlength="40" data-field="patient_reference" bindinput="field" />
<button class="primary" bindtap="preview" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||readOnly}}">先核对申请资料 →</button></view>
<view wx:else class="card"><view class="section-title">{{preview.clinic}} · {{preview.kind_label}}</view><view wx:for="{{preview.rows}}" wx:key="label" class="line"><view class="label">{{item.label}}</view><view>{{item.value}}</view></view><view class="notice">我已核对本人、账号及上述资料。确认后送交本店前台核验，尚不创建预约、治疗或资金。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="confirm" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||readOnly}}">确认送交前台核验</button><button bindtap="revise" disabled="{{busy||readOnly}}">返回修改</button></view>
<navigator open-type="switchTab" class="link" url="/pages/account/index">返回我的办理记录</navigator></view>
